VETTAM -- Variable Eddington Tensor-closed Transport on Adaptive Meshes
Copyright (c) 2020-2026 Shyam Harimohan Menon

Primary reference:
  Menon, S. H., Federrath, C., Krumholz, M. R., et al. 2022,
  MNRAS 512, 401 -- "VETTAM: a scheme for radiation hydrodynamics with
  adaptive mesh refinement using the variable Eddington tensor method"

This module is written to be compiled inside the FLASH code and calls FLASH's
Grid, Driver, Eos, Hydro, Particles and Opacity interfaces. FLASH itself is not
included in or distributed with this release; obtain it from the Flash Center
for Computational Science (https://flash.rochester.edu/site/flashcode/).


